WEBVTT

00:00:56.552 --> 00:01:03.226
2,700 quarter miles
in 2,700 consecutive quarter hours.

00:01:03.226 --> 00:01:07.021
I bring up this long-ago event
for a singular purpose:

00:01:07.021 --> 00:01:11.734
to question what you think you know
about why we watch sports.

00:01:12.860 --> 00:01:17.156
If people lost their minds
watching someone walk in circles,

00:01:17.156 --> 00:01:18.199
(Laughter)

00:01:18.199 --> 00:01:22.203
what can this teach us
about the heart of sports?

00:01:23.496 --> 00:01:26.916
Understanding what compels us
to watch sports,

00:01:26.958 --> 00:01:31.170
it's not just a thought experiment,
although it is that,